n\n  \n  <div class=\"anchor-nav\">\n    <a href=\"#plans\">查看流量方案</a>\n    <a href=\"#features\">核心架构优势</a>\n    <a href=\"#faq\">查阅常见问答</a>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"plans\">\n    <h2>流量方案</h2>\n    <div class=\"plans-list\">\n      <div class=\"plan-row\">\n        <div class=\"plan-name\">基础版</div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥15/月</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action\">选择方案</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-row featured\">\n        <div class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥35/月</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action\">选择方案</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"plan-row\">\n        <div class=\"plan-name\">团队版</div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n          <div class=\"plan-price\">¥85/月</div>\n          <div class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</div>\n        </div>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"plan-action\">选择方案</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"features\">\n    <h2>架构优势</h2>\n    <div class=\"features-grid\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>石板灰美学</h3>\n        <p>沉稳低调的色彩搭配，减少视觉疲劳。界面克制而清晰，专注呈现必要数据。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>多栏网格布局</h3>\n        <p>信息排布井然有序，摒弃冗长滚动，让每一次点击都精准直达目标。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>青色数据标记</h3>\n        <p>关键状态高亮显示，核心指标一目了然，异常状态实时捕捉与纠正。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  \n  <section id=\"faq\">\n    <h2>常见问题</h2>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">01</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>如何开始使用 ampdy 的网络方案？</h3>\n          <p>您只需选择上方适合您的流量方案并完成配置，即可在后台获取专属连接订阅，导入至主流客户端即可使用。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">02</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>支持哪些主流操作系统与客户端？</h3>\n          <p>全面兼容 Windows、macOS、iOS、Android 以及 Linux 等多平台，支持各类标准代理协议客户端。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <div class=\"faq-num\">03</div>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          <h3>流量额度如何计算与重置？</h3>\n          <p>所有方案的流量均按自然月周期进行重置，未用完的流量不累积至下一周期。您可随时在用户面板查看实时消耗情况。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n  <div>© ampdy. All rights reserved.</div>\n  <div>杂志式多栏网络架构与极简方案</div>\n</footer>",
